<title>RUSSIA: Russia prepares municipal securities bill.</title>
<headline>Russia prepares municipal securities bill.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian federal government is preparing a bill on securities issued by municipal and regional governments, spokesman Igor Shabdurasulov said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>He declined to give any details. The bill is one of 37 to be submitted to the State Duma lower house of parliament in the first half of this year, he told a news conference.</p>
<p>Other bills include further parts of the Russian Tax Code, and bills on prices for natural monopolies and concession agreements with foreign investors.</p>
<p>--Irina Demchenko, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
